(5208035, 757225, 77521, '<td valign="top">the light on her cheek is a little distracting.</td>', 'the light on her cheek is a little distracting.', '2009-01-21 00:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208037, 758294, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  That is a hoot. I see pixelation or artifacts on the right side of the blue background though. :~)</td>', 'ROFL.  That is a hoot. I see pixelation or artifacts on the right side of the blue background though. :~)', '2009-01-21 00:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208040, 756933, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - she has gorgeous eyes.  Maybe a touch soft, but a pleasing portrait. :~)</td>', 'WOW - she has gorgeous eyes.  Maybe a touch soft, but a pleasing portrait. :~)', '2009-01-21 00:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208041, 758255, 77521, '<td valign="top">cool shot, nice bokeh</td>', 'cool shot, nice bokeh', '2009-01-21 00:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208045, 756236, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the hint of warmth.  Nice crop and composition. Artful and not at all cheesy.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the hint of warmth.  Nice crop and composition. Artful and not at all cheesy.', '2009-01-21 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208046, 757645, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute look, but the pic strikes me as a snapshot. I copied this into my image editor to see, and some quick adjustments made a huge difference. In particular, the levels adjustment really brightened this up. A little curves and shadow adjust brought some details out of the shadow.</td>', 'A cute look, but the pic strikes me as a snapshot. I copied this into my image editor to see, and some quick adjustments made a huge difference. In particular, the levels adjustment really brightened this up. A little curves and shadow adjust brought some details out of the shadow.', '2009-01-21 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208050, 757830, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - those eyes look like marbles!!! They almost look a touch over sharp. I like the crop and the DOF.</td>', 'WOW - those eyes look like marbles!!! They almost look a touch over sharp. I like the crop and the DOF.', '2009-01-21 00:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208054, 758089, 49954, '<td valign="top">Amen!</td>', 'Amen!', '2009-01-21 00:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208055, 758041, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, only major issue is a lot of graininess that could be either noise or JPEG compression artifacts. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'Love the idea, only major issue is a lot of graininess that could be either noise or JPEG compression artifacts. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-01-21 00:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208056, 758322, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh my gawd.  That is just hilarious. Wish his eyes were in better focus but that set up is just great.</td>', 'Oh my gawd.  That is just hilarious. Wish his eyes were in better focus but that set up is just great.', '2009-01-21 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208058, 758197, 83313, '<td valign="top">Occ... whaaa? I can''t even pronounce it. Probably can''t afford it, either.</td>', 'Occ... whaaa? I can''t even pronounce it. Probably can''t afford it, either.', '2009-01-21 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208059, 758259, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is creepy. It''s like he''s really there, with the reflection on the glasses. The kitty seems a touch oversharp, but that''s wild.</td>', 'That is creepy. It''s like he''s really there, with the reflection on the glasses. The kitty seems a touch oversharp, but that''s wild.', '2009-01-21 00:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208064, 757980, 15711, '<td valign="top">THAT IS CRAZY!!!! I like the harsh editing and the eyes are tack sharp.</td>', 'THAT IS CRAZY!!!! I like the harsh editing and the eyes are tack sharp.', '2009-01-21 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208065, 757925, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrasted light but he looks a touch too pink.</td>', 'I like the high contrasted light but he looks a touch too pink.', '2009-01-21 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208066, 758243, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I like this artistic approach, or if it''s just overprocessed. I may come back to this one.</td>', 'Not sure if I like this artistic approach, or if it''s just overprocessed. I may come back to this one.', '2009-01-21 00:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208071, 758304, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is outstanding. Her hair!!!  Fabulous.  The only thing that bugs me is that odd reflection on the right side.  Otherwise, perfect.</td>', 'That is outstanding. Her hair!!!  Fabulous.  The only thing that bugs me is that odd reflection on the right side.  Otherwise, perfect.', '2009-01-21 00:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208075, 758078, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is totally cool~~~</td>', 'That is totally cool~~~', '2009-01-21 00:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208076, 758343, 83313, '<td valign="top">The strong sepia screams "antique", but that scream is in conflict with the modern plastic pen. Otherwise, it works well, but that conflict of subject and treatment jumped out at me.</td>', 'The strong sepia screams "antique", but that scream is in conflict with the modern plastic pen. Otherwise, it works well, but that conflict of subject and treatment jumped out at me.', '2009-01-21 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208088, 758241, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some grainy pixellation in the blue frames, and a mild lack of clarity. There may be a little extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. Your file size is only 82k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'I see some grainy pixellation in the blue frames, and a mild lack of clarity. There may be a little extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. Your file size is only 82k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. Always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2009-01-21 00:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208102, 757678, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the viewpoint you used. The image as a whole seems a little on the flat side, though. I popped this into my editor and found some quick adjustments of levels, curves and contrast really  brought out some detail and "pop" in this.</td>', 'I like the viewpoint you used. The image as a whole seems a little on the flat side, though. I popped this into my editor and found some quick adjustments of levels, curves and contrast really  brought out some detail and "pop" in this.', '2009-01-21 00:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208104, 758268, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s here. I''ve just been avoiding them. It''s like walking around with a fishbowl on my head. At least they made a good photography subject, however!</td>', 'It''s here. I''ve just been avoiding them. It''s like walking around with a fishbowl on my head. At least they made a good photography subject, however!', '2009-01-21 00:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208106, 758318, 101888, '<td valign="top">Great concept! The small shadow at the bottom right is a bit distracting!</td>', 'Great concept! The small shadow at the bottom right is a bit distracting!', '2009-01-21 00:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208119, 757225, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems like a snapshot I''m afraid. The depth of field is very shallow, and the narrow range of focus does not seem to be where it needs to be. The lighting from the side is also blowing out a lot of detail on her cheek, while the rest of her face is in shadows. I don''t know what your shot settings were, but I am guessing that a narrower f-stop and maybe a different direction for the lighting could have helped. Hard to know for sure without knowing details, however.</td>', 'Seems like a snapshot I''m afraid. The depth of field is very shallow, and the narrow range of focus does not seem to be where it needs to be. The lighting from the side is also blowing out a lot of detail on her cheek, while the rest of her face is in shadows. I don''t know what your shot settings were, but I am guessing that a narrower f-stop and maybe a different direction for the lighting could have helped. Hard to know for sure without knowing details, however.', '2009-01-21 00:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208120, 757229, 101888, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is a great pic. Nice composition and DOF.</td>', 'Wow! This is a great pic. Nice composition and DOF.', '2009-01-21 00:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5208121, 757307, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty smile. I''m a sucker for a pretty smile.</td>', 'Pretty smile. I''m a sucker for a pretty smile.', '2009-01-21 00:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
