(5209503, 758171, 18655, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! The use of wide angle and the angle in which you took the photograph is very suitable since the clouds makes a nice backdrop. The deep DOF looks great and the reflection in the glasses works.<br/>The pose itself makes me think that you''re smelling the fresh air from the sea. Very nice! Upgraded from 6 to 8 on pass #2.</td>', 'Excellent shot! The use of wide angle and the angle in which you took the photograph is very suitable since the clouds makes a nice backdrop. The deep DOF looks great and the reflection in the glasses works.The pose itself makes me think that you''re smelling the fresh air from the sea. Very nice! Upgraded from 6 to 8 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 12:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209508, 758322, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great setup and a good result. The image seems a little dull to me (lack of contrast maybe?) And the relatively large white''ish area in the backdrop doesn''t help.<br/>But all in all a fun image and a very nice looking dog. I upgraded this from a 6 to 7 on pass #2.</td>', 'Great setup and a good result. The image seems a little dull to me (lack of contrast maybe?) And the relatively large white''ish area in the backdrop doesn''t help.But all in all a fun image and a very nice looking dog. I upgraded this from a 6 to 7 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 12:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209511, 758125, 18655, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 on my first pass but upgraded it to an 8 on my second pass. The image is very sharp and certainly eye popping in DPC fashion. Great idea and an excellent result!!</td>', 'I gave this a 6 on my first pass but upgraded it to an 8 on my second pass. The image is very sharp and certainly eye popping in DPC fashion. Great idea and an excellent result!!', '2009-01-21 12:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209514, 758094, 102021, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition!.......good job!.....</td>', 'beautiful composition!.......good job!.....', '2009-01-21 12:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209515, 757819, 102021, '<td valign="top">beautiful!.....</td>', 'beautiful!.....', '2009-01-21 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209526, 757482, 18655, '<td valign="top">What a lovely model! She looks like ms. innocence or maybe mischievous... at the same time... :) Tough to tell and that is one of the reasons this is such a gorgeous image. The fiery red hair, beautiful big eyes an soft skin tones makes this. I gave this a 6 on my first pass but feel I need to upgrade it to an 8 now that I look at it more closely. Great job!</td>', 'What a lovely model! She looks like ms. innocence or maybe mischievous... at the same time... :) Tough to tell and that is one of the reasons this is such a gorgeous image. The fiery red hair, beautiful big eyes an soft skin tones makes this. I gave this a 6 on my first pass but feel I need to upgrade it to an 8 now that I look at it more closely. Great job!', '2009-01-21 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209530, 757418, 18655, '<td valign="top">The tile implies that this might be an environmental portrait. In any case; it''s a great portrait and the colors look like they are spot on! I gave this a 6 on my first pass but upgrading it to a 7. Great job!</td>', 'The tile implies that this might be an environmental portrait. In any case; it''s a great portrait and the colors look like they are spot on! I gave this a 6 on my first pass but upgrading it to a 7. Great job!', '2009-01-21 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209532, 757935, 18655, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful and have gorgeous eyes. Pose and composition is good. Upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.</td>', 'She is beautiful and have gorgeous eyes. Pose and composition is good. Upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209540, 758279, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and eye popping in good ''ol DPC fashion. The blue tones in the shades gives a good contrast to the rest of the image. Smart choice with the black background. Upgraded from a 6 to an 8 on pass #2 after I studied it closer.</td>', 'Very sharp and eye popping in good ''ol DPC fashion. The blue tones in the shades gives a good contrast to the rest of the image. Smart choice with the black background. Upgraded from a 6 to an 8 on pass #2 after I studied it closer.', '2009-01-21 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209542, 758304, 18655, '<td valign="top">First the nitpick: The one curly hair on the inside of her left (my right) glass is very annoying and should have been removed.<br/>Other thank that it is a great image with a very appropriate model for the task at hand - particularly since it makes the glasses look even bigger.<br/>upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.</td>', 'First the nitpick: The one curly hair on the inside of her left (my right) glass is very annoying and should have been removed.Other thank that it is a great image with a very appropriate model for the task at hand - particularly since it makes the glasses look even bigger.upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 13:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209570, 758292, 18655, '<td valign="top">Definitely portrays today''s teenagers. Looks great in b/w. Sharp but at the same time diffuse background. Upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.</td>', 'Definitely portrays today''s teenagers. Looks great in b/w. Sharp but at the same time diffuse background. Upgraded from a 6 to a 7 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 13:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209575, 757105, 18655, '<td valign="top">Good model for the occasion. Looks good in b/w and very clean looking shot. Upgraded from a 5 to a 6 on pass #2.</td>', 'Good model for the occasion. Looks good in b/w and very clean looking shot. Upgraded from a 5 to a 6 on pass #2.', '2009-01-21 13:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5209597, 757786, 18655, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept but it works well. Nice subtle lighting that gives it good depth. Upgraded from a 5 (what was I thinking!!) to a 7 on second pass and after looking at it closer.</td>', 'Interesting concept but it works well. Nice subtle lighting that gives it good depth. Upgraded from a 5 (what was I thinking!!) to a 7 on second pass and after looking at it closer.', '2009-01-21 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
