(5209700, 757169, 80458, '<td valign="top">the reflection in the sunglasses along with the gray corner in the top right are distracting to an otherwise great photograph!</td>', 'the reflection in the sunglasses along with the gray corner in the top right are distracting to an otherwise great photograph!', '2009-01-21 14:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
