(5211807, 758335, 83313, '<td valign="top">You should use the full 720 pixels allowed in at least one direction. I''m afraid in spite of that, this still comes off to me as a snapshot. Focus is sharp, and colors are good, but there are a lot of distracting elements in the background, including a bar going through her head. Harsh midday sun is also a problem here. I''ve found that close-in detail shots or converting to b/w seems to help with the midday shots.</td>', 'You should use the full 720 pixels allowed in at least one direction. I''m afraid in spite of that, this still comes off to me as a snapshot. Focus is sharp, and colors are good, but there are a lot of distracting elements in the background, including a bar going through her head. Harsh midday sun is also a problem here. I''ve found that close-in detail shots or converting to b/w seems to help with the midday shots.', '2009-01-22 13:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211817, 756964, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting and cute shot of this girl. Composition does not sit right with me, especially the OOF piece of car inthe foreground, but the pic is sharp with good colors and lighting. I am guessing this was a shot of opportunity and not staged or you would have composed it differently.</td>', 'An interesting and cute shot of this girl. Composition does not sit right with me, especially the OOF piece of car inthe foreground, but the pic is sharp with good colors and lighting. I am guessing this was a shot of opportunity and not staged or you would have composed it differently.', '2009-01-22 13:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211818, 756392, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of words you decided to highlight with the lens. Is it these glasses that have seen better days, or your eyes?</td>', 'I like the choice of words you decided to highlight with the lens. Is it these glasses that have seen better days, or your eyes?', '2009-01-22 13:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211820, 756538, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just too cute.</td>', 'Just too cute.', '2009-01-22 13:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211826, 757335, 83313, '<td valign="top">The focus is on the bird and the couple in the background, rather than what was intended to be the subject couple. Must be some bright sun, as both of those people in the background are shielding their eyes, and it only draws more attention back there.</td>', 'The focus is on the bird and the couple in the background, rather than what was intended to be the subject couple. Must be some bright sun, as both of those people in the background are shielding their eyes, and it only draws more attention back there.', '2009-01-22 13:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211828, 758078, 83313, '<td valign="top">On my calibrated monitor, I can see some dark smudging on the right, just under the glasses and in the top right corner. I''ll be that won''t show on my uncalibrated monitor at home, however.</td>', 'On my calibrated monitor, I can see some dark smudging on the right, just under the glasses and in the top right corner. I''ll be that won''t show on my uncalibrated monitor at home, however.', '2009-01-22 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5211830, 757365, 83313, '<td valign="top">The odd composition of this shot would work for me except for the focus being on the bricks instead of the person.</td>', 'The odd composition of this shot would work for me except for the focus being on the bricks instead of the person.', '2009-01-22 13:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212013, 758304, 327, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the reflection but this is very <u>eye catching </u>and very, very cute. Love the idea and color treatment. Well done.</td>', 'Too bad about the reflection but this is very eye catching and very, very cute. Love the idea and color treatment. Well done.', '2009-01-22 15:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212020, 756186, 327, '<td valign="top">Simple but good. Very commerical shot, could be stock.</td>', 'Simple but good. Very commerical shot, could be stock.', '2009-01-22 15:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212026, 758368, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like a stock shot, excellent light, focus and pose. I think the bottom with a tighter crop might of added to the shot a bit. Over all it''s top quaility. Congrats one of the best.</td>', 'Looks like a stock shot, excellent light, focus and pose. I think the bottom with a tighter crop might of added to the shot a bit. Over all it''s top quaility. Congrats one of the best.', '2009-01-22 15:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212027, 757828, 327, '<td valign="top">Blown away by the depth of colors. Really shows well on my monitor. Great focus.</td>', 'Blown away by the depth of colors. Really shows well on my monitor. Great focus.', '2009-01-22 15:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212030, 758239, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe try using a tripod so the focus is better and try different types of lighting. This is pretty harsh.</td>', 'Maybe try using a tripod so the focus is better and try different types of lighting. This is pretty harsh.', '2009-01-22 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212047, 758307, 97954, '<td valign="top">Nicely set in a past period - well done.</td>', 'Nicely set in a past period - well done.', '2009-01-22 15:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212049, 758343, 97954, '<td valign="top">Would have played better if the accessories were less modern. Nice vignette and sepia tone but they do not go well with the motel pen and pad.</td>', 'Would have played better if the accessories were less modern. Nice vignette and sepia tone but they do not go well with the motel pen and pad.', '2009-01-22 15:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212051, 756392, 97954, '<td valign="top">Love that book!  :)  Nice magnification of selective words.</td>', 'Love that book!  :)  Nice magnification of selective words.', '2009-01-22 15:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212054, 757070, 97954, '<td valign="top">Good concept!</td>', 'Good concept!', '2009-01-22 15:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212229, 757786, 75192, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous model - he has some lips on him! Love his nose too. <br/> <br/>I like the composition, lighting - everything, apart from the slight graininess on the glasses.</td>', 'Gorgeous model - he has some lips on him! Love his nose too.  I like the composition, lighting - everything, apart from the slight graininess on the glasses.', '2009-01-22 17:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212237, 757925, 327, '<td valign="top">I like it. Great light.</td>', 'I like it. Great light.', '2009-01-22 17:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212242, 757312, 75192, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha! Love this one! 10.</td>', 'Ha ha ha! Love this one! 10.', '2009-01-22 17:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212244, 757169, 327, '<td valign="top">Sexy set up. I like this would only suggest a tighter crop on her. Nice lighting, and the glasses are perfect.</td>', 'Sexy set up. I like this would only suggest a tighter crop on her. Nice lighting, and the glasses are perfect.', '2009-01-22 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5212252, 757962, 327, '<td valign="top">For some reason this reminds me of Richard Gere in ?Broken I think it was called. Anyway love the rich tones and the pose.</td>', 'For some reason this reminds me of Richard Gere in ?Broken I think it was called. Anyway love the rich tones and the pose.', '2009-01-22 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
