(5216189, 756592, 100495, '<td valign="top">The model and set-up are great, but I think I''d like it more if it looked more ''street'' than ''studio''.<br/> <br/>Just re-read the comment.  I should have added that by ''street'' I mean an outside shot with some stereotypical urban background, or graffiti etc. He looks like he has that ''arrogance of youth'' that would make brilliant record artwork.<br/> <br/>I''ve also bumbed the score up as I like it more today ;)</td>', 'The model and set-up are great, but I think I''d like it more if it looked more ''street'' than ''studio''. Just re-read the comment.  I should have added that by ''street'' I mean an outside shot with some stereotypical urban background, or graffiti etc. He looks like he has that ''arrogance of youth'' that would make brilliant record artwork. I''ve also bumbed the score up as I like it more today ;)', '2009-01-24 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
