(5216831, 758033, 67152, '<td valign="top">A couple of thoughts about your entry.  <br/> <br/>I think the composition is pretty solid with the centered face - i just wish the sides of the hands were not cropped quite as tight.  <br/> <br/>The model''s face is very pretty and I think you did a great job with capturing good skin tones on the hands - but the skin just below her eyes is a bit pinkish/purple - likely due to processing.  I personally like the super blue eyes and red lips, but i wonder how well it will sit with others.<br/> <br/>I think the jacket is one of the big problems - it is sooo busy that it distracts fro the glasses<br/> <br/>I think the image is a bit soft and that probably cost you a bit as well and even though the glasses are white, the image does almost seem to come across as have a slightly yellow tint...but I have no idea why!<br/> <br/>I like your model - very pretty - you need to use her more often - just put her in a bit better lighting and either get closer so you don''t have to crop so much, or crop her wider.<br/> <br/>I hope it helps!</td>', 'A couple of thoughts about your entry.   I think the composition is pretty solid with the centered face - i just wish the sides of the hands were not cropped quite as tight.   The model''s face is very pretty and I think you did a great job with capturing good skin tones on the hands - but the skin just below her eyes is a bit pinkish/purple - likely due to processing.  I personally like the super blue eyes and red lips, but i wonder how well it will sit with others. I think the jacket is one of the big problems - it is sooo busy that it distracts fro the glasses I think the image is a bit soft and that probably cost you a bit as well and even though the glasses are white, the image does almost seem to come across as have a slightly yellow tint...but I have no idea why! I like your model - very pretty - you need to use her more often - just put her in a bit better lighting and either get closer so you don''t have to crop so much, or crop her wider. I hope it helps!', '2009-01-24 17:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
