(5217388, 758239, 97166, '<td valign="top">A 3 for:<br/> <br/>- blown highlights (try different exposure methods to avoid this, if possible)<br/>- bad white balance.  If your camera doesn''t have a great auto-white balance, or manual white balance modes, try shooting in different lighting (say outdoors, or under fluorescent lights, to try and achieve less color cast in your photo (in this case, it is overly yellow).<br/> <br/>- focus.  The overall photo is very blurry and fuzzy, which means that focus was missed. Either this is because the camera wasn''t held steady, or the shutter was pressed before auto-focus was achieved properly.<br/> <br/>Another element that can be improved is composition (try finding more interesting ways to pose and/or shoot from different angles.  Straight on shots are rarely going to get much score.)</td>', 'A 3 for: - blown highlights (try different exposure methods to avoid this, if possible)- bad white balance.  If your camera doesn''t have a great auto-white balance, or manual white balance modes, try shooting in different lighting (say outdoors, or under fluorescent lights, to try and achieve less color cast in your photo (in this case, it is overly yellow). - focus.  The overall photo is very blurry and fuzzy, which means that focus was missed. Either this is because the camera wasn''t held steady, or the shutter was pressed before auto-focus was achieved properly. Another element that can be improved is composition (try finding more interesting ways to pose and/or shoot from different angles.  Straight on shots are rarely going to get much score.)', '2009-01-25 02:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217389, 758335, 97166, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3 for:<br/> <br/>- size.  Far too small to really impact.  It''s best if you can use the full pixel allowances that the site allows.</td>', 'I gave this a 3 for: - size.  Far too small to really impact.  It''s best if you can use the full pixel allowances that the site allows.', '2009-01-25 02:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5217390, 758254, 97166, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 2 for:<br/> <br/>- exposure. Highly over-exposed in some areas trying to compensate for the darker areas. Try shooting in more evenly lit areas to avoid this, or research techniques to expose for highlights while maintaining shadowed areas better.<br/> <br/>- Focus.  Nothing in this photo is in focus.<br/> <br/>- Subject matter.  While you have glasses here, they are presented very plainly with no real impact to the viewer.</td>', 'I gave this a 2 for: - exposure. Highly over-exposed in some areas trying to compensate for the darker areas. Try shooting in more evenly lit areas to avoid this, or research techniques to expose for highlights while maintaining shadowed areas better. - Focus.  Nothing in this photo is in focus. - Subject matter.  While you have glasses here, they are presented very plainly with no real impact to the viewer.', '2009-01-25 02:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
