(5221301, 758073, 51747, '<td valign="top">The character is cute and you captured it well. My question is: is shooting somebody else''s work your work? 5</td>', 'The character is cute and you captured it well. My question is: is shooting somebody else''s work your work? 5', '2009-01-26 23:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5221315, 757850, 51747, '<td valign="top">A nice comfortable expression. Colors are good, focus is sharp but the shadows caused by the glasses make the eyes disappear. Too bad.<br/> <br/>Edit: Perhaps the word ''disappear'' was too strong. IMHO the eyes could be more appreciated if they weren''t in shadow.<br/> <br/> My most humble apologies to those who took offense.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-28 12:20:21.</i></td>', 'A nice comfortable expression. Colors are good, focus is sharp but the shadows caused by the glasses make the eyes disappear. Too bad. Edit: Perhaps the word ''disappear'' was too strong. IMHO the eyes could be more appreciated if they weren''t in shadow.  My most humble apologies to those who took offense.', '2009-01-27 00:00:18.000000', '2009-01-28 12:20:21.000000', 1),
(5221328, 758259, 51747, '<td valign="top">The cat is awesome. I can see how you can meet the challenge with the pic in the background. Still a stretch though.</td>', 'The cat is awesome. I can see how you can meet the challenge with the pic in the background. Still a stretch though.', '2009-01-27 00:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
