(5222258, 758079, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m fairly certain you won a challenge about a year ago with a very similar shot, yes?  Anyway, I hope this does well for you, too.  Your catch of her iris pattern is beautiful.  I''m more and more suspect of "letterbox" frames as I think they lend something to the photos that aren''t inherent in the photo itself -- leaves me always trying to imagine the photo without the frame!</td>', 'I''m fairly certain you won a challenge about a year ago with a very similar shot, yes?  Anyway, I hope this does well for you, too.  Your catch of her iris pattern is beautiful.  I''m more and more suspect of "letterbox" frames as I think they lend something to the photos that aren''t inherent in the photo itself -- leaves me always trying to imagine the photo without the frame!', '2009-01-27 16:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5222263, 757850, 61961, '<td valign="top">Lovely (self portrait, yes?).  This could easily be an eyeglasses advertisement.  I know this is fairly straightforward, but I think it is my challenge favorite.</td>', 'Lovely (self portrait, yes?).  This could easily be an eyeglasses advertisement.  I know this is fairly straightforward, but I think it is my challenge favorite.', '2009-01-27 16:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
