(5222482, 758213, 102415, '<td valign="top">If you had caught more of the golden gate bridge reflection in the glasses that would have made for a more interesting photograph plus it could have added more focus on the glasses rather than the blurred bridge in the background.</td>', 'If you had caught more of the golden gate bridge reflection in the glasses that would have made for a more interesting photograph plus it could have added more focus on the glasses rather than the blurred bridge in the background.', '2009-01-27 19:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
