(5222877, 757365, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just surreal enough to be irrational.  Just irrational enough to be surreal.  I like the circular array of objects: the dark void; the brick wall; the shadow; the light (both compelling and dangerous, as befits a worthy attraction);  and of course the mildly android-looking protagonist with the magical lipstick glasses.  Everything means something here, there''s not a wasted photon, and everything''s connected to everything else.  It''s like a game of scissors-paper-stone in which each element of the photograph is ''stronger'' than something and ''weaker'' than something else.  And happily, there is no solution; it''s irrational.<br/> <br/>The most interesting photograph in the challenge.  I therefore give it a 10, plus the Order of the Thumb.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Just surreal enough to be irrational.  Just irrational enough to be surreal.  I like the circular array of objects: the dark void; the brick wall; the shadow; the light (both compelling and dangerous, as befits a worthy attraction);  and of course the mildly android-looking protagonist with the magical lipstick glasses.  Everything means something here, there''s not a wasted photon, and everything''s connected to everything else.  It''s like a game of scissors-paper-stone in which each element of the photograph is ''stronger'' than something and ''weaker'' than something else.  And happily, there is no solution; it''s irrational. The most interesting photograph in the challenge.  I therefore give it a 10, plus the Order of the Thumb.', '2009-01-27 23:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
