(5223056, 757482, 97166, '<td valign="top">Oh, I know all about girls needing to "dress up". lol.  The 4 year old is crazy about it and loves her ''lipstick'' (Just flavored lip gloss in her case though).  I thought about it after commenting, but then left it anyway as I''d already said it and figured eh, it still stands. It''s not that there IS lipstick, just that it becomes the focus of the shot. Too bright and shiny, you know?<br/> <br/>Anyway, girls. Eesh.</td>', 'Oh, I know all about girls needing to "dress up". lol.  The 4 year old is crazy about it and loves her ''lipstick'' (Just flavored lip gloss in her case though).  I thought about it after commenting, but then left it anyway as I''d already said it and figured eh, it still stands. It''s not that there IS lipstick, just that it becomes the focus of the shot. Too bright and shiny, you know? Anyway, girls. Eesh.', '2009-01-28 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
