(5224285, 757850, 51747, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scooter97:</b></div><hr/><i> A nice comfortable expression. Colors are good, focus is sharp but the shadows caused by the glasses make the eyes disappear. Too bad.<br/> <br/>Edit: Perhaps the word ''disappear'' was too strong. IMHO the eyes could be more appreciated if they weren''t in shadow.<br/> <br/> My most humble apologies to those who took offense. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Originally posted by scooter97: A nice comfortable expression. Colors are good, focus is sharp but the shadows caused by the glasses make the eyes disappear. Too bad. Edit: Perhaps the word ''disappear'' was too strong. IMHO the eyes could be more appreciated if they weren''t in shadow.  My most humble apologies to those who took offense. ', '2009-01-28 12:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
