(5226053, 757830, 27605, '<td valign="top">How in the world were you able to focus this self-portrait so precisely?  Great work, and congrats on the high placement in the challenge.</td>', 'How in the world were you able to focus this self-portrait so precisely?  Great work, and congrats on the high placement in the challenge.', '2009-01-29 12:57:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226094, 757312, 7473, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this is on the front page.  The halo in this picture is very distracting and looking through the other pictures there are others that are technically better.</td>', 'I am surprised this is on the front page.  The halo in this picture is very distracting and looking through the other pictures there are others that are technically better.', '2009-01-29 13:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226117, 757312, 50931, '<td valign="top">I''m also surprised to see such a high score here. I would use this as an example of how HDR or shadow/highlight can totally break an image if they are overdone. There is a way to use these dynamic range increasing tools that does not leave such distracting artifacts. Pushing it this far is like turning the radius up way too high in unsharp mask.</td>', 'I''m also surprised to see such a high score here. I would use this as an example of how HDR or shadow/highlight can totally break an image if they are overdone. There is a way to use these dynamic range increasing tools that does not leave such distracting artifacts. Pushing it this far is like turning the radius up way too high in unsharp mask.', '2009-01-29 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5226194, 757312, 102403, '<td valign="top">Dang man how much did those oakly''s cost, i wont those, and nice dog!</td>', 'Dang man how much did those oakly''s cost, i wont those, and nice dog!', '2009-01-29 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 0),
