(5226236, 758125, 54645, '<td valign="top">Congrats Irene. I don''t get the comment about levels and curves...what did you do differently?<br/> <br/>ETA: Oh, you just discovered curves! Ouch...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-29 15:36:35.</i></td>', 'Congrats Irene. I don''t get the comment about levels and curves...what did you do differently? ETA: Oh, you just discovered curves! Ouch...', '2009-01-29 15:35:29.000000', '2009-01-29 15:36:35.000000', 0),
(5226243, 757312, 54645, '<td valign="top">I''m not surprised to see a mixed bag of comments. I happen to love the concept and humor here, but I''m in the camp of too much halo! But let''s face, this image cracks me up, and it put a smile on the face of my daughters. So...I love the ride I get with the photograph, but there is a bit of a bump in the road with the tonemapping!</td>', 'I''m not surprised to see a mixed bag of comments. I happen to love the concept and humor here, but I''m in the camp of too much halo! But let''s face, this image cracks me up, and it put a smile on the face of my daughters. So...I love the ride I get with the photograph, but there is a bit of a bump in the road with the tonemapping!', '2009-01-29 15:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
