(5229603, 757830, 76430, '<td valign="top">PAW - Excellent picture.  Funny reading the notes it looks very intentional and posed, but it was just a test shot.  Nice color in the irises and very good crop, if it is cropped.  I wish you could have softened the glasses shadows some.  It''s good to see what you look like.  you don''t look like a troll at all.  ;-)</td>', 'PAW - Excellent picture.  Funny reading the notes it looks very intentional and posed, but it was just a test shot.  Nice color in the irises and very good crop, if it is cropped.  I wish you could have softened the glasses shadows some.  It''s good to see what you look like.  you don''t look like a troll at all.  ;-)', '2009-01-31 19:36:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5230260, 757830, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great job, I really like the focus on the eyes.  Great finish too!</td>', 'Great job, I really like the focus on the eyes.  Great finish too!', '2009-02-01 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5231716, 757830, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait!  Excellent work with the lights, great clarity and sharpness.  Hint - men look good this sharp, women not so much (we prefer just a little less detail, thanks!).  I wanna know how you held both flashes and got yourself in such good focus AND hit the shutter, all at the same time.  Having tried SPs awhile back, I never really could get myself in focus very well.</td>', 'Very good portrait!  Excellent work with the lights, great clarity and sharpness.  Hint - men look good this sharp, women not so much (we prefer just a little less detail, thanks!).  I wanna know how you held both flashes and got yourself in such good focus AND hit the shutter, all at the same time.  Having tried SPs awhile back, I never really could get myself in focus very well.', '2009-02-01 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 0),
